flowchart LR
  HK[Global hotkey] --> MIC[Mic selection and capture]
  MIC --> VAD[VAD and streaming chunks]
  VAD --> ASR[Local or approved cloud ASR]
  ASR --> N[Normalise and preserve raw transcript]
  N --> C[Dictionary, snippets, protected tokens, style]
  C --> P[Insertion preview/policy]
  P --> TSF[TSF / semantic input]
  P --> UIA[UI Automation]
  P --> SI[Unicode SendInput]
  P --> CB[Clipboard fallback]
  C --> L[Correction learning and analytics]
